# Copy to /opt/nusantara/etc/caddy/public-gate.caddy on the Mac mini
# (docs/public-domain.md §5) and put the real hash in place of HASH.
#
# Only requests that came through Cloudflare carry Cf-Connecting-IP; tailscale
# serve, the deploy's health check and anything else on loopback do not, so the
# tailnet sees no prompt.
#
# Two bare directives, not a `route`: a route sorts AFTER `handle`, and the
# Caddyfile's handle blocks answer every request first.
@public header Cf-Connecting-IP *
basic_auth @public {
	nusantara HASH
}
